### Step 2 — dispatchPrimaryTask (role: researcher) via codex-cli

`session-artifacts/primary-assignment.json`: `provenance.kind: "inline"`,
`mutation: "read-only"`, `workId: null` -- no `stage`/`workflow`/`operation`/
`taskSpec` field anywhere on the object (inline Assignments never carry
them, ADR-006 R8). `session-artifacts/primary-dispatch-plan.json`:
`executorId: "codex-cli"`, `governance.providerFamily: "codex"` (correctly
derived this time -- the P00.4 fix, confirmed live). `session-artifacts/primary-result.json`:
```
