provenance.executor.source.scope: "cliOverride"   <- --executor reached the resolver
evidence.gitBefore === evidence.gitAfter (626e057b...)   <- zero mutation
settleReports: [{"path": ".../agent-report.md", "sha256": "8635f6..."}]
```
Worker-produced artifacts, copied verbatim:
`session-artifacts/primary-agent-report.md` ("`name`: `forgent`, `version`:
