### Step 3 — proposeConsult (role: reviewer, specialist actor) via codex-cli

`session-artifacts/consult-assignment.json`: `contextRefs:
["asgn_...op_002"]` (the primary's own Assignment id -- the whole point of
a consult, not leakage), `provenance.inline.caller.parentAssignmentId:
"asgn_...op_002"` -- ADR-006's existing field, reused unchanged, proving the
consult's `caller.parentAssignmentId` genuinely references the primary
actor's real Assignment. `session-artifacts/consult-result.json`: `status:
"done", confidence: "reported"`, `evidence.gitBefore === evidence.gitAfter`.
`session-artifacts/consult-agent-report.md`: "Confirmed package name/version
string: `forgent@0.1.0`." -- an independent second read that agrees with
the primary, not an echo (different wording, same repo file).

### Step 4 — resumeSession view (`replaySession`, not re-derived)

Final `session-artifacts/session.json`: `actors: [{"id":"primary",...},
{"id":"specialist","role":"reviewer"}]`, `assignmentRefs:
["asgn_...op_002","asgn_...op_003"]`. `session-artifacts/events.jsonl`, in
