result-linked(primary), actor-bound(specialist),
assignment-created(specialist), result-linked(specialist)` -- 7 events, no
duplicates, no out-of-order refs (matches what `replaySession` itself would
reject otherwise -- this session passed its own fail-closed reconstruction,
confirmed live by `resumeSession` actually returning this view rather than
throwing).

